00:01:48.080 --> 00:01:53.090
<b>The Sky Priestess and Star People</b>

00:01:48.080 --> 00:01:53.090
<b>The Sky Priestess and Star People</b>

00:01:48.080 --> 00:01:53.090
<b>The Sky Priestess and Star People</b>

00:01:48.250 --> 00:01:50.580
<b>You are all from down below?</b>

00:01:50.580 --> 00:01:53.040
<b>Welcome to my home.</b>

00:01:53.040 --> 00:01:58.720
<b>As much as I would love to enjoy some tea with you,</b>

00:01:59.470 --> 00:02:02.470
<b>this really isn't a good time, unfortunately.</b>

00:02:03.010 --> 00:02:04.600
<b>Right.</b>

00:02:04.600 --> 00:02:08.350
<b>Pega was worried that something had happened to you or the Starwhale.</b>

00:02:08.680 --> 00:02:09.940
<b>Was he?</b>

00:02:11.060 --> 00:02:12.110
<b>Behind you!</b>

00:02:25.830 --> 00:02:27.830
<b>Forgive me.</b>

00:02:27.830 --> 00:02:32.710
<b>As you can see, the Starwhale is suffering from an illness.</b>

00:02:34.000 --> 00:02:41.550
<b>When it is ill, it condenses the toxins inside it into these dark beings.</b>

00:02:42.470 --> 00:02:45.260
<b>I call them "disease demons."</b>

00:02:46.180 --> 00:02:50.980
<b>The disease demons are what make the Starwhale ill,</b>

00:02:51.770 --> 00:02:54.650
<b>and if they begin pouring out of the Starwhale,</b>

00:02:55.230 --> 00:03:00.570
<b>they will wreak havoc upon the islands of the Starsea and the land below.</b>

00:03:00.990 --> 00:03:02.740
<b>I see...</b>

00:03:02.740 --> 00:03:05.240
<b>We don't want that to happen.</b>

00:03:05.240 --> 00:03:08.450
<b>How can we cure the Starwhale of its illness?</b>

00:03:08.950 --> 00:03:11.250
<b>The Starwhale loves songs very much.</b>

00:03:12.120 --> 00:03:16.710
<b>The star people's song will give the Starwhale strength,</b>

00:03:17.210 --> 00:03:19.880
<b>allowing it to fight the disease.</b>

00:03:19.880 --> 00:03:21.300
<b>The star people?</b>

00:03:21.800 --> 00:03:26.010
<b>Maybe there's a whole country inside the Starwhale.</b>

00:03:26.760 --> 00:03:28.510
<b>Aria, was it?</b>

00:03:28.510 --> 00:03:32.230
<b>I think she was one of the star people as well.</b>

00:03:32.600 --> 00:03:35.940
<b>Although she seemed a little odd for one.</b>

00:03:36.520 --> 00:03:37.610
<b>Aria?</b>

00:03:38.270 --> 00:03:40.230
<b>You know Aria?</b>

00:03:40.690 --> 00:03:41.650
<b>Yes.</b>

00:03:41.650 --> 00:03:45.110
<b>She helped one of our friends when he got lost alone.</b>

00:03:45.820 --> 00:03:49.580
<b>She was having trouble walking,</b>

00:03:49.580 --> 00:03:52.960
<b>and she couldn't remember why she was here.</b>

00:03:53.540 --> 00:03:54.870
<b>I see...</b>

00:03:55.630 --> 00:03:57.750
<b>Where is she now?</b>

00:03:58.500 --> 00:04:00.880
<b>She's traveling with another group we brought here.</b>

00:04:01.550 --> 00:04:04.130
<b>They're looking for the Flame Dragon, as we lost him on the way.</b>

00:04:04.130 --> 00:04:07.050
<b>Oh, the Flame Dragon?</b>

00:04:07.800 --> 00:04:11.930
<b>He's already big enough to carry all of you, isn't he?</b>

00:04:11.930 --> 00:04:14.890
<b>I will go and find him.</b>

00:04:14.890 --> 00:04:18.770
<b>I will take you to the star people,</b>

00:04:18.770 --> 00:04:21.400
<b>and then tell you more about what's happening.</b>

00:04:21.690 --> 00:04:22.690
<b>But...</b>

00:04:32.950 --> 00:04:36.830
<b>That sprite of me will lead the way.</b>

00:04:36.830 --> 00:04:38.920
<b>Nice to meet you!</b>

00:04:39.420 --> 00:04:42.460
<b>You go and find Char's friends,</b>

00:04:43.050 --> 00:04:45.340
<b>and you find the Flame Dragon.</b>

00:04:45.340 --> 00:04:46.800
<b>Okay!</b>

00:04:45.340 --> 00:04:46.800
<b>Okay!</b>

00:04:48.180 --> 00:04:49.050
<b>That's Griff.</b>

00:04:49.050 --> 00:04:50.100
<b>He won't bite.</b>

00:04:52.560 --> 00:04:54.560
<b>They must be old friends.</b>

00:04:58.480 --> 00:04:58.940
<b>Huh?</b>

00:05:00.650 --> 00:05:02.690
<b>Are you okay, Aria-san?</b>

00:05:03.820 --> 00:05:05.110
<b>What's wrong?</b>

00:05:05.110 --> 00:05:06.950
<b>Are you feeling all right?</b>

00:05:06.950 --> 00:05:08.320
<b><i>I'm fine.</i></b>

00:05:08.320 --> 00:05:11.450
<b><i>Just a bit of a headache.</i></b>

00:05:11.950 --> 00:05:14.660
<b>Hey, I got a call from Shinku!</b>

00:05:14.660 --> 00:05:17.830
<b>Someone's gonna lead us to them!</b>

00:05:17.830 --> 00:05:19.540
<b>Got it!</b>

00:05:20.290 --> 00:05:22.500
<b>Let's find a place where you can rest.</b>

00:05:23.090 --> 00:05:25.880
<b>Bear with it until our escort arrives, okay?</b>

00:05:28.010 --> 00:05:32.350
<b>Sky priestess, you are so big!</b>

00:05:32.350 --> 00:05:37.440
<b>It's because I am a descendant of the local deities you know and love,</b>

00:05:37.850 --> 00:05:41.480
<b>just like that fox lady traveling with you.</b>

00:05:42.020 --> 00:05:44.230
<b>Ah, so you were!</b>

00:05:44.230 --> 00:05:50.240
<b>It was a long time ago that I decided to live with the Starwhale...</b>

00:05:50.910 --> 00:05:53.280
<b>and take responsibility as the sky priestess.</b>

00:05:54.330 --> 00:05:57.000
<b>It's quite nice, except for this illness.</b>

00:05:57.500 --> 00:06:01.500
<b>The reflecting pool lets me see not only inside the Starwhale,</b>

00:06:02.040 --> 00:06:06.050
<b>but also outside, and even the people down below.</b>

00:06:06.050 --> 00:06:07.590
<b>I see.</b>

00:06:08.550 --> 00:06:10.010
<b>We're almost there.</b>

00:06:19.810 --> 00:06:22.440
<b>This is the village of the star people,</b>

00:06:22.440 --> 00:06:24.270
<b>blessed with the gift of water.</b>

00:06:25.860 --> 00:06:27.570
<b>Okay, time to go down.</b>

00:06:27.570 --> 00:06:28.690
<b>What?</b>

00:06:28.690 --> 00:06:32.660
<b>Priestess, I think this is too far of a fall.</b>

00:06:32.660 --> 00:06:33.450
<b>Oh.</b>

00:06:33.950 --> 00:06:35.200
<b>It's okay!</b>

00:06:35.200 --> 00:06:37.790
<b>We can carry you all down!</b>

00:06:45.170 --> 00:06:46.500
<b>Look at that statue!</b>

00:06:46.500 --> 00:06:50.680
<b>That's exactly like the star people in our books!</b>

00:06:50.680 --> 00:06:54.850
<b>That's the statue of the last elder of the village.</b>

00:06:55.220 --> 00:06:59.730
<b>The star people can breathe in air <i>and</i> water</b>

00:06:59.730 --> 00:07:02.310
<b>and swim faster than fish!</b>

00:07:03.270 --> 00:07:05.940
<b>We'd call them mermaids back home!</b>

00:07:05.940 --> 00:07:07.570
<b>Mermaids?</b>

00:07:07.570 --> 00:07:09.320
<b>But now...</b>

00:07:09.320 --> 00:07:09.990
<b>Huh?</b>

00:07:11.740 --> 00:07:12.740
<b>Oh?</b>

00:07:15.030 --> 00:07:17.410
<b>That's the priestess, and...</b>

00:07:17.410 --> 00:07:19.620
<b>People from down below?</b>

00:07:19.620 --> 00:07:22.040
<b>I've seen them before, too.</b>

00:07:22.040 --> 00:07:24.830
<b>It's me, Farine!</b>

00:07:25.170 --> 00:07:30.260
<b>I'd like to talk about some things with you and these people from down below!</b>

00:07:36.260 --> 00:07:38.180
<b>A-Are you all right?</b>

00:07:38.180 --> 00:07:40.850
<b>You all don't seem well...</b>

00:07:40.850 --> 00:07:43.850
<b>The disease demons have infected them as well.</b>

00:07:43.850 --> 00:07:48.400
<b>And once we're infected, we get...</b>

00:07:48.400 --> 00:07:53.200
<b>Headaches, fevers, joint pain, and much more...</b>

00:07:53.200 --> 00:07:56.870
<b>The worst part is the sore throat.</b>

00:07:56.870 --> 00:08:01.120
<b>A lot of us can't speak at all.</b>

00:08:01.660 --> 00:08:03.620
<b>This is what's behind it all.</b>

00:08:06.080 --> 00:08:09.880
<b>We're doing well compared to some of the others, but...</b>

00:08:09.880 --> 00:08:14.880
<b>There are a lot of very sick people underwater.</b>

00:08:15.220 --> 00:08:18.510
<b>Some of them can't even get out of bed.</b>

00:08:18.510 --> 00:08:21.640
<b>Not to mention Aria is nowhere to be seen...</b>

00:08:21.640 --> 00:08:23.730
<b>About her...</b>

00:08:24.230 --> 00:08:25.480
<b>Hey!</b>

00:08:25.480 --> 00:08:26.900
<b>Hey!</b>

00:08:27.690 --> 00:08:29.650
<b>Guys!</b>

00:08:30.190 --> 00:08:31.650
<b>We're here!</b>

00:08:32.150 --> 00:08:34.200
<b>Nanami, everyone!</b>

00:08:34.200 --> 00:08:35.650
<b>Where'd the boat come from?</b>

00:08:35.650 --> 00:08:38.660
<b>It's one of my secret gadgets!</b>

00:08:41.040 --> 00:08:43.790
<b>This girl isn't doing too well.</b>

00:08:43.790 --> 00:08:45.660
<b>Have you got a place where she can rest?</b>

00:08:45.660 --> 00:08:46.920
<b>Y-Yes.</b>

00:08:47.920 --> 00:08:48.670
<b>Wait, Aria!</b>

00:08:48.670 --> 00:08:49.630
<b>What?!</b>

00:08:49.630 --> 00:08:53.510
<b>How'd you end up with these people?</b>

00:08:53.510 --> 00:08:55.420
<b>Oh, Aria!</b>

00:08:55.800 --> 00:08:57.550
<b>You know her?</b>

00:08:57.840 --> 00:08:59.350
<b>Of course!</b>

00:08:59.350 --> 00:09:01.850
<b>She <i>lives</i> here!</b>

00:09:01.850 --> 00:09:04.730
<b>And she's our diva!</b>

00:09:04.730 --> 00:09:07.520
<b>She's the most important person in the Star Festival.</b>

00:09:07.520 --> 00:09:11.940
<b>She disappeared two days ago, 
and we were so worried about her.</b>

00:09:13.360 --> 00:09:20.870
<b>As far as we could tell, she doesn't remember anything except for her name and the disease demons.</b>

00:09:20.870 --> 00:09:23.290
<b>She can't speak, either.</b>

00:09:23.290 --> 00:09:24.580
<b>I see...</b>

00:09:25.290 --> 00:09:28.120
<b>But at least she's all right.</b>

00:09:28.120 --> 00:09:31.710
<b>I don't know how this happened,</b>

00:09:31.710 --> 00:09:35.550
<b>but she'll be fine once she recovers!</b>

00:09:36.800 --> 00:09:40.090
<b>The Starwhale swallows many things.</b>

00:09:40.090 --> 00:09:48.850
<b>It can swallow tainted air and miasma and purify it in its body.</b>

00:09:49.400 --> 00:09:53.190
<b>It's what keeps the sky clean.</b>

00:09:53.900 --> 00:09:56.690
<b>I hear the voice of the Starwhale,</b>

00:09:56.690 --> 00:10:01.030
<b>and the star people sing their songs of healing and festivity.</b>

00:10:01.030 --> 00:10:03.410
<b>That keeps the Starwhale in good health</b>

00:10:03.410 --> 00:10:06.330
<b>and the ecosystem within it rich.</b>

00:10:06.700 --> 00:10:10.880
<b>This village is usually much prettier than this.</b>

00:10:11.460 --> 00:10:14.340
<b>It's especially dark right now.</b>

00:10:14.340 --> 00:10:17.670
<b>We've dealt with the disease demons before,</b>

00:10:18.090 --> 00:10:22.970
<b>but the diva and star people's songs cured it very quickly.</b>

00:10:22.970 --> 00:10:24.220
<b>But—</b>

00:10:24.220 --> 00:10:28.770
<b>most of the star people can't sing this time around.</b>

00:10:28.770 --> 00:10:32.980
<b>And our Diva has no voice or memory of anything.</b>

00:10:33.360 --> 00:10:35.690
<b>The Starwhale is suffering as well.</b>

00:10:35.690 --> 00:10:38.780
<b>I can hardly hear it.</b>

00:10:38.780 --> 00:10:41.110
<b>I don't know what to do...</b>

00:10:43.910 --> 00:10:47.370
<b>Will getting rid of the disease demons do the trick?</b>

00:10:49.160 --> 00:10:53.170
<b>They are born from the Starwhale's flesh.</b>

00:10:53.170 --> 00:10:55.790
<b>Although you could decrease their numbers,</b>

00:10:55.790 --> 00:10:59.380
<b>it's not effective in the long run.</b>

00:11:00.050 --> 00:11:01.380
<b>Um...</b>

00:11:01.380 --> 00:11:03.090
<b>I have a question.</b>

00:11:03.090 --> 00:11:04.470
<b>Go ahead.</b>

00:11:04.470 --> 00:11:09.390
<b>Does the Starwhale only like the song of some particular people?</b>

00:11:09.390 --> 00:11:10.890
<b>Of course!</b>

00:11:10.890 --> 00:11:14.480
<b>She must have a beautiful, soothing voice.</b>

00:11:14.980 --> 00:11:17.320
<b>And, of course, be a good singer.</b>

00:11:17.820 --> 00:11:19.360
<b>Then, uh...</b>

00:11:19.740 --> 00:11:23.860
<b>I might know someone fit for the job!</b>

00:11:23.860 --> 00:11:28.660
<b>I see, there are people down below who can sing!</b>

00:11:28.660 --> 00:11:29.870
<b>Of course we can!</b>

00:11:30.330 --> 00:11:34.120
<b>And we're talking about a world-class superstar!</b>

00:11:34.710 --> 00:11:39.340
<b>Good thing I brought a video player!</b>

00:11:39.340 --> 00:11:43.930
<b>I was wondering why that was in your chest!</b>

00:11:43.930 --> 00:11:45.390
<b>You're a real genius.</b>

00:11:46.390 --> 00:11:50.890
<b>Our princess' song is undeniably a large part of Biscotti culture!</b>

00:11:51.430 --> 00:11:55.100
<b>I wanted to share it with the people of the Skysea!</b>

00:11:55.730 --> 00:11:58.150
<b>And it's rolling!</b>

00:11:59.190 --> 00:12:02.700
My dreams will surely come true

00:11:59.190 --> 00:12:02.700
Yume wa kanau kitto

00:12:02.700 --> 00:12:06.740
Negai goto ga afure dasu

00:12:02.700 --> 00:12:06.740
I have so many things to wish for

00:12:06.740 --> 00:12:10.200
I will find you now

00:12:06.740 --> 00:12:10.200
Tsukamaeru yo ima

00:12:10.200 --> 00:12:14.790
In the light

00:12:10.200 --> 00:12:14.790
Hikari no naka de

00:12:13.460 --> 00:12:15.830
<b>What a beautiful voice.</b>

00:12:16.670 --> 00:12:18.170
<b>Such a great song.</b>

00:12:22.170 --> 00:12:22.970
<b>Huh?</b>

00:12:25.970 --> 00:12:27.090
<b>Whoa!</b>

00:12:27.090 --> 00:12:29.260
<b>I'm feeling better all of a sudden!</b>

00:12:28.220 --> 00:12:31.640
I want to convey to you

00:12:28.220 --> 00:12:31.640
Todoketai tsutaetai

00:12:29.260 --> 00:12:32.560
<b>I feel a lot less weary now.</b>

00:12:31.640 --> 00:12:35.020
these feelings I have for you

00:12:31.640 --> 00:12:35.020
Taisetsu na kono omoi

00:12:35.020 --> 00:12:42.110
And the love that I kept in my heart

00:12:35.020 --> 00:12:42.110
Mune no oku ni dakishimeteta itoshii kimochi wa

00:12:35.640 --> 00:12:38.900
<b>Wow, I can sing now!</b>

00:12:42.110 --> 00:12:45.400
In the sky, in the wind

00:12:42.110 --> 00:12:45.400
Aoi sora kaze no naka

00:12:43.610 --> 00:12:47.660
<b>Can I let the others hear this too?</b>

00:12:45.400 --> 00:12:48.370
A summer flower blooms

00:12:45.400 --> 00:12:48.370
Natsuiro no hana ga hiraku

00:12:47.660 --> 00:12:49.530
<b>Absolutely!</b>

00:12:48.370 --> 00:12:55.790
This is my chance

00:12:48.370 --> 00:12:55.790
Ima koko ni aru koi no chance

00:12:50.030 --> 00:12:51.580
<b>Wonderful.</b>

00:12:52.290 --> 00:12:56.870
<b>She can sing the song for the Star Festival!</b>

00:13:03.590 --> 00:13:07.720
<b>Shinku and I will go get the princess!</b>

00:13:07.720 --> 00:13:11.930
<b>The double hero express will be back in a flash!</b>

00:13:11.930 --> 00:13:13.810
<b>Good luck!</b>

00:13:13.810 --> 00:13:15.680
<b>We'll take care of things here!</b>

00:13:15.680 --> 00:13:18.730
<b>Lead the way, priestess.</b>

00:13:18.730 --> 00:13:19.860
<b>Got it.</b>

00:13:19.860 --> 00:13:20.810
<b>All right...</b>

00:13:21.320 --> 00:13:23.190
<b>See you soon!</b>

00:13:23.190 --> 00:13:25.820
<b>Take care!</b>

00:13:26.400 --> 00:13:29.530
<b>Okay, what do we do now?</b>

00:13:29.530 --> 00:13:32.240
<b>You should be safe here.</b>

00:13:32.830 --> 00:13:36.210
<b>We could fend off some of the disease demons.</b>

00:13:37.080 --> 00:13:42.460
<b>My true body should be luring and defeating the larger ones,</b>

00:13:42.460 --> 00:13:46.720
<b>but I would appreciate any help I could get.</b>

00:13:46.720 --> 00:13:47.720
<b>All right.</b>

00:13:47.720 --> 00:13:48.800
<b>We're on it!</b>

00:13:48.800 --> 00:13:51.220
<b>Rico, you should be our headquarters.</b>

00:13:51.640 --> 00:13:53.430
<b>Stay here with Aria-san.</b>

00:13:53.430 --> 00:13:55.060
<b>Roger that!</b>

00:13:55.390 --> 00:13:57.940
<b>Char, Chief, could you stay here?</b>

00:13:58.640 --> 00:14:01.980
<b>Can't leave the professor alone in case anything happens.</b>

00:14:01.980 --> 00:14:03.520
<b>Roger!</b>

00:14:03.520 --> 00:14:04.690
<b>Understood.</b>

00:14:06.190 --> 00:14:10.320
<b>Don't you want to beat up some really big game?</b>

00:14:10.570 --> 00:14:11.660
<b>Definitely.</b>

00:14:12.320 --> 00:14:16.250
<b>We don't want the ladies to have much trouble.</b>

00:14:16.250 --> 00:14:19.920
<b>Well, I think they're tough enough to fend for themselves.</b>

00:14:20.420 --> 00:14:22.840
<b>Those four make one hell of a team.</b>

00:14:22.840 --> 00:14:23.710
<b>They really do.</b>

00:14:24.920 --> 00:14:26.460
<b><i>But...</i></b>

00:14:26.460 --> 00:14:29.420
<b><i>I hope Aria's all right.</i></b>

00:14:31.010 --> 00:14:35.470
<b>Gaul-sama seemed awfully worried about Aria-san, huh?</b>

00:14:35.470 --> 00:14:38.230
<b>He doesn't seem like the type to do that.</b>

00:14:38.230 --> 00:14:41.520
<b>It <i>could</i> be because she saved him, but...</b>

00:14:42.060 --> 00:14:44.360
<b>Maybe it's because she's so pretty!</b>

00:14:44.770 --> 00:14:48.610
<b>Yeah, she might be right down his alley.</b>

00:14:48.610 --> 00:14:49.650
<b>Yeah!</b>

00:14:51.110 --> 00:14:52.570
<b>First it was Leo-sama's turn,</b>

00:14:52.570 --> 00:14:54.740
<b>and now it's time for Gaul to shine!</b>

00:14:55.080 --> 00:14:56.990
<b>I wonder how Leo-sama feels about this.</b>

00:14:56.990 --> 00:15:00.910
<b>I'm pretty sure she likes Lief.</b>

00:15:01.330 --> 00:15:03.290
<b>And Gaul-sama...</b>

00:15:03.290 --> 00:15:06.090
<b>We're his old friends <i>and</i> guards,</b>

00:15:06.090 --> 00:15:09.170
<b>so his love life definitely has us...</b>

00:15:09.170 --> 00:15:10.920
<b>interested.</b>

00:15:11.550 --> 00:15:14.720
<b>Is there no chance it'd be one of you?</b>

00:15:14.720 --> 00:15:16.310
<b>No way.</b>

00:15:16.310 --> 00:15:17.970
<b>I agree.</b>

00:15:17.970 --> 00:15:20.060
<b>He doesn't seem like that type.</b>

00:15:20.730 --> 00:15:23.060
<b>Although it's nothing like love...</b>

00:15:23.600 --> 00:15:26.320
<b>We've got a special bond between us.</b>

00:15:26.770 --> 00:15:29.280
<b>And it's very, very strong.</b>

00:15:29.280 --> 00:15:32.490
<b>As in the bond between a lord and his guards?</b>

00:15:32.490 --> 00:15:36.910
<b>As life-long friends and allies
through both good and bad times.</b>

00:15:36.910 --> 00:15:40.250
<b>We're basically family at this point.</b>

00:15:40.250 --> 00:15:44.670
<b>It's like I have a little brother and two little sisters.</b>

00:15:45.040 --> 00:15:46.250
<b>Really?</b>

00:15:52.170 --> 00:15:54.550
<b>We've been waiting for you!</b>

00:15:54.550 --> 00:15:55.680
<b>You'd better be ready...</b>

00:15:55.680 --> 00:15:57.300
<b>To have a taste of this!</b>

00:15:57.720 --> 00:15:59.220
<b>Bring it on!</b>

00:16:02.140 --> 00:16:03.440
<b>Take a right here!</b>

00:16:06.690 --> 00:16:10.110
<b>The Starwhale's mouth is open right now!</b>

00:16:12.150 --> 00:16:13.400
<b>I see it!</b>

00:16:13.400 --> 00:16:14.950
<b>We're outside!</b>

00:16:16.370 --> 00:16:19.450
<b>I'll go down below with you.</b>

00:16:19.450 --> 00:16:21.160
<b>Thank you!</b>

00:16:21.160 --> 00:16:23.460
<b>I'll call the princess!</b>

00:16:23.460 --> 00:16:26.290
<b>I should ask Cou-sama for help, too!</b>

00:16:30.340 --> 00:16:33.970
<b>I wonder what happened to Aria-dono.</b>

00:16:33.970 --> 00:16:35.470
<b>I don't know...</b>

00:16:35.470 --> 00:16:37.260
<b>She doesn't look too good.</b>

00:16:38.850 --> 00:16:41.850
<b>I did bring some medicine,</b>

00:16:41.850 --> 00:16:45.140
<b>but I'm not sure what effect it'll have on the star people.</b>

00:16:45.140 --> 00:16:46.650
<b>It's okay.</b>

00:16:46.650 --> 00:16:48.520
<b>It's the thought that counts.</b>

00:16:49.060 --> 00:16:53.860
<b>Aria was always looking at the people down below.</b>

00:16:53.860 --> 00:16:57.240
<b>She was always watching through the reflecting pool.</b>

00:16:58.070 --> 00:16:59.910
<b>You know, those, uh, war shows?</b>

00:16:59.910 --> 00:17:01.410
<b>Those cool festivals?</b>

00:17:01.870 --> 00:17:04.000
<b>We have a lot of those.</b>

00:17:04.000 --> 00:17:06.670
<b>She really liked those,</b>

00:17:06.670 --> 00:17:10.380
<b>and said that she wanted to go and watch sometime.</b>

00:17:10.380 --> 00:17:14.170
<b>We'd always tell her that it was impossible.</b>

00:17:14.170 --> 00:17:16.800
<b>It's not impossible at all!</b>

00:17:16.800 --> 00:17:20.720
<b>But down below is all land and hardly any water!</b>

00:17:20.720 --> 00:17:24.060
<b>And I heard most of the water is saltwater anyway.</b>

00:17:24.060 --> 00:17:26.230
<b>Well, yes...</b>

00:17:26.230 --> 00:17:31.900
<b>We can't stay out of clean, fresh water for too long.</b>

00:17:31.900 --> 00:17:35.440
<b>Our technology can take care of that!</b>

00:17:35.990 --> 00:17:37.110
<b>Let's see...</b>

00:17:37.110 --> 00:17:40.620
<b>We prepare a large engine, get a box or bowl made of crystal panels,</b>

00:17:40.620 --> 00:17:42.950
<b>fill it with pure water,</b>

00:17:42.950 --> 00:17:44.450
<b>and a little this, and a little that...</b>

00:17:44.450 --> 00:17:47.080
<b>How's this look?</b>

00:17:48.330 --> 00:17:53.050
<b>This will let us have any number of any size for any number of people,</b>

00:17:53.050 --> 00:17:58.930
<b>and we've got the technology to adjust the
temperature and maintain the purity of the water.</b>

00:17:58.930 --> 00:17:59.720
<b>I see...</b>

00:18:00.090 --> 00:18:04.100
<b>This would let us star people explore the land.</b>

00:18:04.100 --> 00:18:05.390
<b>Yeah.</b>

00:18:05.390 --> 00:18:06.680
<b>It's great!</b>

00:18:06.680 --> 00:18:09.520
<b>I'm sure Aria would love to hear this.</b>

00:18:09.520 --> 00:18:13.480
<b>We should've tried to contact the people down below earlier.</b>

00:18:13.480 --> 00:18:18.150
<b>It's difficult for us to come to the Starsea.</b>

00:18:18.150 --> 00:18:21.370
<b>We had to ride the Flame Dragon up here.</b>

00:18:21.370 --> 00:18:29.830
<b>Only heroes and lords with flying sacred weapons can come on their own.</b>

00:18:30.370 --> 00:18:35.750
<b>Oh, I've heard about a hero that came here!</b>

00:18:36.000 --> 00:18:38.340
<b>Yes, there was.</b>

00:18:39.260 --> 00:18:41.840
<b>It was Adele and her comrades.</b>

00:18:42.140 --> 00:18:45.640
<b>We have her autograph in our grandmother's house!</b>

00:18:45.640 --> 00:18:47.850
<b>Do you know about Adele-sama, the hero?</b>

00:18:47.850 --> 00:18:49.560
<b>Oh, do we <i>know</i> her!</b>

00:18:49.560 --> 00:18:54.230
<b>She just told us her old tales a few days ago!</b>

00:18:55.070 --> 00:18:56.690
<b>She's still alive?</b>

00:18:56.690 --> 00:18:57.730
<b>Wow!</b>

00:18:57.730 --> 00:19:00.070
<b>She's very, very youthful.</b>

00:19:00.070 --> 00:19:05.160
<b>And I was adopted and raised by one of those comrades!</b>

00:19:06.830 --> 00:19:10.500
<b>It all shows how small this world actually is.</b>

00:19:10.500 --> 00:19:11.870
<b>Indeed!</b>

00:19:15.170 --> 00:19:16.340
<b>Who's that?</b>

00:19:16.840 --> 00:19:18.670
<b>I don't know...</b>

00:19:18.670 --> 00:19:20.760
<b>But I've seen him somewhere...</b>

00:19:22.380 --> 00:19:23.720
<b>Aria...</b>

00:19:24.010 --> 00:19:24.930
<b>He...</b>

00:19:24.930 --> 00:19:26.890
<b>doesn't feel right to me...</b>

00:19:27.260 --> 00:19:29.220
<b>Be careful, everyone!</b>

00:19:29.220 --> 00:19:31.270
<b>Are you Aria-dono's friend?</b>

00:19:35.020 --> 00:19:36.150
<b>Move.</b>

00:19:38.360 --> 00:19:39.530
<b>Farine-dono!</b>

00:19:46.910 --> 00:19:47.660
<b>Priestess!</b>

00:19:48.790 --> 00:19:50.410
<b>Hold it right there!</b>

00:20:09.720 --> 00:20:10.930
<b>This is...</b>

00:20:10.930 --> 00:20:12.230
<b>the disease demon's toxin!</b>

00:20:12.520 --> 00:20:15.560
<b>Give Aria back!</b>

00:20:21.780 --> 00:20:25.570
<b>Everybody, take Aria and hide!</b>

00:20:25.570 --> 00:20:27.450
<b>Got it!</b>

00:20:33.960 --> 00:20:35.420
<b>Flower storm!</b>

00:20:38.250 --> 00:20:39.210
<b>Begone!</b>

00:20:40.250 --> 00:20:42.340
<b>Fox god, Priestess!</b>

00:20:47.970 --> 00:20:49.680
<b>Demon, begone!</b>

00:20:50.600 --> 00:20:52.100
<b>Go away!</b>

00:21:13.540 --> 00:21:14.750
<b>Aria...</b>

00:21:15.460 --> 00:21:16.790
<b>Our promise...</b>

00:21:18.040 --> 00:21:19.330
<b>Are you...</b>

00:21:19.330 --> 00:21:21.090
<b>Are you Verde?</b>

00:21:22.840 --> 00:21:24.050
<b>Move.</b>

00:21:31.600 --> 00:21:35.310
<b>I'm hearing some trouble from the village.</b>

00:21:35.310 --> 00:21:36.430
<b>Really?</b>

00:21:43.780 --> 00:21:44.900
<b>Aria.</b>

00:21:47.150 --> 00:21:48.200
<b>Aria...</b>

00:21:48.740 --> 00:21:49.990
<b>You promised me.</b>

00:21:50.620 --> 00:21:53.540
<b>Sing your song to me...</b>

00:21:54.450 --> 00:21:56.080
<b>and only me.</b>

00:21:57.910 --> 00:21:59.120
<b><i>Verde?</i></b>

